eading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Academic Requirement paragraph refers to an ''Associate of Arts'' while the rest of the page says Associate of Science; possible catalog inconsistency.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The recommended semester sequence mentions ''PSYC C1000 or PSYC 150, or equivalent''; the ''or equivalent'' does not appear in the requirements table.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Cerritos College''s site (census run census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Cerritos College' and r.control_number = '20512' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
