 lists DH 499; the reader found it not in the text.","where":"Cerritos College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints COMM C1004, COMM 125 for this program; the state''s Program Course File does not list them.","where":"Cerritos College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 114-116.5 units; the catalog prints 120-122 units.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog text begins mid-way through an outcomes/goals list; the first visible line (''s and professional associations.'') is a truncated fragment and was not recorded. The heading of that list is not in the text, so a reviewer should confirm whether these lines are program learning outcomes, program goals or competencies. The lines beginning ''To encourage...'' and ''To defend...'' read like program goals rather than outcomes.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Lower division also requires ''*Biochemistry or Organic Chemistry with Biochemistry'' (4.0-5.0 units). It has no course code because Cerritos does not offer it and it must be taken at another institution, so it is not recorded as a course.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The lower division block prints ''Total Units for Lower Division Coursework 26-27'' under the table, but the summary at the end prints 26.0-27.5. The block''s stated value uses the table figure.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The 4.0-4.5 range is printed on the PSYC 210 row and covers the statistics choice as a whole (PSYC 210, STAT C1000, STAT C1000E or ECON 210). Units are not 