re":"Mt. San Antonio College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints NURS 115, NURS 212 for this program; the state''s Program Course File does not list them.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The anatomy/physiology sequences are printed as paired ''or'' rows (ANAT 10A or ANAT 35; ANAT 10B or ANAT 36) under ''Select one of the following sequences: 8-10''; recorded as two sequence blocks sharing one option_group. The 8-10 total is printed once for the whole choice and is copied onto both blocks. No units are printed beside the individual ANAT courses.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Units are printed only on the first row of each ''or'' group; alternatives have units null because the catalog prints none beside them.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog prints ''MICR 1''; the closed list stores it as ''MICR1'' with no units. Treated as the same course (catalog_addition false); reviewer should confirm.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"NURS 115 and NURS 212 are not in the closed list and are recorded as catalog additions. NURS 212 shares the title ''Preceptorship in Nursing'' and 2 units with closed-list NURS 11, which may be a renumbering.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Prerequisite Courses and ADN General Education Requirements lists repeat courses also listed under Required Courses; only the Required Courses list is recorded. Footnotes there say CHLD 10 group must be completed before NURS 115 and PSYC C1000 before NURS 207 (NURS 207 is not in the required list).","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"NURS 200 Role Transition is a non-course admission requirement and is not in the required course list; it is not recorded.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ge_pattern recorded as local GE: the text says students must complete additional associate degree GE areas (Mathematics and Quantitative Reasoning, Arts and Humanities, Social Political and Economic Institutions, Ethnic Studies) plus Physical Well-Being and Reading Competency graduation requirements, without naming a transfer pattern.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The single Program Learning Outcome printed on the outcomes tab is an admission-step statement rather than a typical learning outcome; copied as printed. The tab also refers to SLOs elsewhere (''Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program'') which are not in the text.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page also lists other Nursing options (LVN 30-Unit, LVN to RN, RN Generic) in navigation only; their sections are not read.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '08087' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
