edure","text":"The Level II coursework subheading is printed as ''Completion of Music Studies Level II - Jazz Coursework'' even though this is the Performance certificate. This may be a catalog error; please check.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"MUS 160 is printed as ''(.5 unit course. 1 unit required)'' with 1 unit beside it, so it is recorded at 1 unit. The student takes 1 unit of the 0.5-unit course.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The MUS 171 row carries the parenthetical ''(Choose two electives (three units minimum))'', which looks like a display artifact.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Level I elective rule is ''Choose two electives (three units minimum)'', printed 3-6. It is recorded as choose_courses 2. A three-unit minimum also applies.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog prints ''MUS 31'' (Concert Choir). The closed list stores it as ''MUS31'', so it is treated as the same closed-list course and is not an addition.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The piano pathway is printed as ''MUS 172 & MUS 173 ... 2 Or MUS 172J & MUS 173J''. It is recorded as two option blocks in option_group ''Piano pathway''. The 2 units are printed beside the MUS 172/173 pair only, and no per-course units are printed. A correction note dated 9/9/26 says the piano display was updated to clarify the two pathways.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"In the catalog, MUS 261A and MUS 261B are printed after the piano pathway rows. They are grouped here with the other required Level II courses.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The ensemble list does not print units beside its courses, so those course units are null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Outcomes tab prints the heading ''Program Learning Objectives'' and a link to ''Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program.'' No outcomes are printed, so the outcomes list is empty.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Many codes in the section are absent from the closed list and are flagged as catalog additions: MUS 120, 145, 172, 173, 172J, 173J, 261A, 261B, 29, 29B, 31B, 34, 36, 38, 44B, 45B, 49B.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '45976' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
