lyses. Have an understanding of legal practices relating to business.''); recorded as printed, one entry per line. A reviewer may check whether these were meant as separate outcomes.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The ''Units: 18.00'' total for Required Core Courses covers the three required courses plus the three ''Select one course'' choices; it is recorded on the first block, and each ''Select one course'' block carries its own printed 3.00.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"BUS-10H is treated as the honors twin of BUS-10.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ACC-1A, BUS-10H and CIS-1A are marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog; their status in the 2026-2027 catalog should be checked.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Closed-list codes MAG 54 and MAG 70 appear in the catalog as MAG-54 and MAG-70 and are treated as the same courses.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Total of 30.00 units is printed for the program; the certificate award title cites 18 or greater semester units, consistent with the 30-unit total.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '22742' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
