eader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Required Courses: two ''Select one of the following: 3.00'' choices (BUS-10 or honors BUS-10H; CAT-3 or cross-listed CIS-3) are recorded as single entries with alternatives in the all-required block; BUS-30 and MKT-20 are read as required outright since the block totals 12 units (3+3+3+3). A reviewer may prefer the two ''select one'' choices as separate choose_courses blocks.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Elective Courses: ''Select four courses, at least one from each cluster'' (12 units). Cluster 1 (printed 6.00): ACC-55 or CAT-55, ACC-65, BUS-20. Cluster 2 (printed 15.00): BUS-18A, CAT-31, MAG-47 or BUS-47, MAG-51, MAG-53, MAG-70. Cluster 3 (printed 9.00): MKT-40, MKT-41, MKT-42. The at-least-one-per-cluster constraint is not expressible in the block and is recorded here. The printed cluster totals (6, 15, 9) do not match the sum of their listed courses for Clusters 1 and 2.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"A stray ''3.00'' line appears after CAT-31 in Cluster 2 with no course beside it; possibly a formatting artifact.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ACC-55 is not in the closed list (catalog_addition true); CAT-55 is its OR alternative and is in the closed list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"BUS-10 and BUS-10H are marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog, which may indicate they are no longer offered.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"CAT-31 is titled ''Business Communication Fundamentals'' in the catalog vs ''Business Communications Fundamentals'' in the closed list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '31898' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
