d'' pairs recorded as alternatives. In Area 4 it is unclear whether the ''Only one may be used'' group covers only STAT-C1000/STAT-C1000H or also PSYC-48 and SOC-48 (cross-listed, same title); PSYC-48 and SOC-48 recorded as separate entries—reviewer should check.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog uses HIST- subject prefix while the closed list has HIS; HIST codes marked catalog_addition true. SOC-48 is not in the closed list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ETS-8 title in catalog is ''Introduction to Black Feminism and Womanism'' vs closed list ''Introduction to Black Feminism''.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '43897' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
